    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Test workflow setup\n1. Import `jina-reader-fetch-url.workflow.v6.json`.\n2. In the main workflow, open **Increment Rate Counter** and re-select your Redis credential.\n3. Save the main workflow.\n4. Import this test workflow.\n5. Open **Call Jina Reader Workflow** and select the imported main workflow.\n6. Run this test manually.\n\nExpected output: `status: ok`, `fetched: true`, a populated top-level `content` field, `rateLimit.counter <= 20`, and `retry.succeededAttempt` showing which attempt worked.\n\nFor failure testing, pass a bad URL path/domain or reduce `requestTimeoutMs`; the final response should include `status: error`, `error`, and `retry.errors[]` with one entry per failed Reader attempt.",
